  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "﻿### Added\n- New error-level build check (DotNetToolsMustBeNativeAotPolicy) requires dotnet tool projects (PackAsTool) to be published as native AOT and trimmed, so the tool stays fast to start and self-contained; projects can opt out with BuildCheckAllowNonAotTool, which must be given a reason\n### Fixed\n- Restored the coverage exclusion for ConsoleAppFramework generated sources\n### Changed\n- Publish buildcheck as a native AOT, trimmed, per-RID dotnet tool - #490\n- Parse the command line with ConsoleAppFramework, keeping -Solution, -WarningAsErrors and -PreReleaseBuild as aliases - #490",
